Node ID=12 Needless torment smart
Text=You are correct, small one, it is immoral willingly to cause needless suffering. If you mean to imply that we are guilty of such a sin in taking this town, you are mistaken. 
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=12 Needless torment 2 smart
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=12 Needless torment 2 smart
Text=Just as a herdsman is justified in eating from his flock to sustain his family's need, we had a great need when we came to this town. We caused no more suffering than we had to, and have killed none who didn't forcefully resist us. 
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You hide behind unwarranted assumptions and facile analogies. Your "morality" is nothing but a poor rationalization of the atrocities you are guilty of.
Go to node ID=19 Disagree with morality smart
Action work in progress=show only if very high intelligence, give karma bonus
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Good Karma
}
Icon=Attribute Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You ignore the fact that humans are intelligent and thus are qualitatively different from animals, despite what you say.
