Node ID=12 Needless torment 3 smart
Text=It is a human failing to assume that there is a clear divide between themselves and other animals. You are not special nor are you unique, you are just another organism on the chain with rights and abilities appropriate to your place. The animals you consume or harness doubtless feel a drive to live just as you do. 
