Node ID=30 Forefathers
Text=Our forebears were creatures of legend. Great demigods like Atlas and my namesake, Rhea. Theirs was a glorious legacy that still exists in the mythology of your kind.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What was the world like then?
Go to node ID=30 History 2

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You're more ugly than glorious, really.
Go to node ID=31 Beauty is in the eye

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I'm sorry, I don't have time for this. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=90 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
