Node ID=54 Seeking the Memnosesthion
Text=Yes, we have come here seeking our Memnosesthion. When the time came for him to pass on his mneme, the coward chose to run from his responsibility, stealing our memory. His selfish disregard for his children and his duty has forced us to follow him into your lands.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And that is why you are here in Toulouse.
Go to node ID=55 Toulouse
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=55 Toulouse
Text=We followed his trail as far as this village, but he escaped before we could make good his capture and the trail has grown cold. It was then that Menoetius happened upon the oracle that advised us to await your arrival. And thus we have stayed here amidst the wreckage of this town.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=That explains much, but why did you destroy the town?
